Each capture starts by verifying both authoritative result statuses/counts and clean exact product HEAD.
The script starts its own loopback ThreadingHTTPServer on an ephemeral port.
No remote resources allowed by Playwright route; no real SDK execution in the report.
Native output is renamed from Playwright's random filename to browser.native.webm after context.close().

